<SPT><TTL>DELIVERY, STORAGE, AND HANDLING</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Protect materials from weather, soil, and damage during delivery, storage, and construction.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Deliver materials in their original packages, containers, or bundles bearing the brand name and the name and type of the material.</TXT><BRK/>
