<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Coordinate type and capacity of fire extinguishers with fire protection cabinets to ensure fit and function.  
According to NFPA 10, maximum mounting height for fire extinguishers weighing<MET> 18 kg</MET><ENG> 40 lb</ENG> or less is<MET> 1.5 meters</MET><ENG>
 60 inches</ENG> from finished floor to top of extinguisher; for those weighing more, it is<MET> 1 meter</MET><ENG> 42 inches</ENG> from finished 
floor to top of extinguisher.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Size</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Dimension cabinets to accommodate the specified fire extinguishers.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT><SPT><TTL><SUB>Wall Brackets</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
