<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Identification</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide lettering complying with authorities having jurisdiction for letter style, size, spacing, and location. Locate as indicated by the drawings.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<LST>Identify bracket-mounted fire extinguishers with the words "FIRE EXTINGUISHER" in red letter decals applied to mounting surface.</LST><BRK/>
<BRK/>
